<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS6.SSS0.Px2" title="In A.6 Stage 6: Narrative Generation and Quality Filtering ‣ Appendix A Dataset Construction Details ‣ AgentEscapeBench: Evaluating Out-of-Domain Tool-Grounded Reasoning in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Final validation.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
